  "content": [
    {
      "text": "A cymbal-playing Levite appointed leader of David’s choir. Founded a family of singers called the “sons of Asaph” or “children of Asaph”; mentioned in the titles of various Psalms. See 1 Chr. 6:39; 15:17, 19; 16:4–7, 37; 25:1–9; 2 Chr. 5:12; 20:14; Ezra 2:41; 3:10; Neh. 7:44; Ps. 50; 73–83.",
